  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 2. OUR STORY -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="story" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Our Story</h2>
      <div class="manifesto">

        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          Bitcoin showed us that when money belongs to the people, it becomes unstoppable.
        </p>

        <p>
          For the first time in human history, ordinary citizens — not governments, 
          not banks, not any single institution — created a currency that works across every 
          border, every timezone, every language. That was the spark. That spark changed everything.
        </p>

        <p>
          But Bitcoin was the beginning, not the destination. Sending it is slow and expensive 
          for daily shopping. Your balance is visible to anyone who looks. And billions of people 
          still can't use it easily for the simple things that matter most — paying rent, 
          buying groceries, sending money to a parent in another country.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>OST is the next chapter of that revolution.</strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          We took the unstoppable heart of Bitcoin and gave it everything a real global citizen 
          needs: transactions that settle in under a second, privacy that hides your balance and 
          amounts the way physical cash always did, and a shopping experience so simple you just 
          browse a store and click "Pay." No forms. No delays. No questions.
        </p>

        <p>
          OST connects to every currency you already have — Bitcoin, Ethereum, stablecoins, even 
          your local bank account — through trusted open bridges. Your money flows freely into 
          OST and back out whenever you want. No middlemen standing between you and your family.
        </p>

        <p>
          And here is the part that makes us smile every day: a tiny fraction of every 
          transaction — so small you'll never notice it — quietly flows into an open fund 
          that builds decentralized satellite infrastructure. Fast, free internet for every 
          village, every island, every forgotten corner of our shared planet. And someday, 
          for the space communities our children will build together.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are brothers and sisters. The lines on maps are drawn by power; 
          they don't exist in our hearts. OST is simply a tool that lets us 
          trade freely and privately, the way humans were always meant to.
        </p>

        <p class="manifesto-closing">
          This is not about rebellion. It's about remembering that we belong to each other.<br>
          <strong>Welcome to the next step. Welcome home.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

