  <section id="revolution" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">The Revolutionary Next Step</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Everything you wish Bitcoin could do for daily life — OST already does.
      </p>

      <div class="features-grid">

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Faster &amp; Cheaper</h3>
          <p>
            Transactions settle in under 400 milliseconds on Solana. 
            Fees are fractions of a cent. Send $10 or $10,000 — same speed, same cost.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
          <h3>Private by Default</h3>
          <p>
            Token-2022 Confidential Transfers hide your balance and every amount 
            using zero-knowledge proofs. No one sees what you have or where it goes — 
            like handing cash in an envelope.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🛒</div>
          <h3>One-Click Shopping</h3>
          <p>
            Browse any store with the OST Pay button. Click "Pay" → confirm in your 
            wallet → done. Shopify-simple. The merchant gets OST instantly, 
            no visible trail, no waiting.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Quantum-Safe</h3>
          <p>
            Governance stakers can vote to upgrade OST's encryption to lattice-based 
            post-quantum algorithms the moment standards are finalized. 
            Your money stays safe for decades.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🗳️</div>
          <h3>You Govern It</h3>
          <p>
            Stake OST to vote on every protocol change. No company, no CEO, no single 
            nation decides what happens. The community — every brother and sister — decides together.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🛰️</div>
          <h3>Space for Everyone</h3>
          <p>
            A tiny 0.1% of every fee flows to an open fund building decentralized satellite 
            internet. Fast, free connectivity for every village on Earth — and someday, 
            for humanity among the stars.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PAY DEMO -->
