  <!-- 5. TRANSFER FROM ANY CURRENCY -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="transfer" class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Bring Your Money From Anywhere</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Already hold Bitcoin? Ethereum? Any other crypto? Or even local money? 
        Bring it into OST in one click. True interoperability — your existing 
        money becomes OST privately, spendable anywhere.
      </p>

      <div class="transfer-steps">

        <div class="transfer-step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <h3>Bridge Your Crypto</h3>
          <p>
            Use <strong>Wormhole (Portal)</strong> or <strong>deBridge</strong> — the most 
            trusted bridges connecting Solana to Bitcoin, Ethereum, and 30+ other chains. 
            Lock your BTC or ETH on its home chain → receive a wrapped version on Solana 
            in minutes. Fully decentralized, fully audited.
          </p>
          <div class="step-logos">
            <span class="logo-pill">Wormhole</span>
            <span class="logo-pill">deBridge</span>
            <span class="logo-pill">Portal</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="transfer-step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <h3>Swap to OST</h3>
          <p>
            Once your tokens are on Solana, open <strong>Jupiter Aggregator</strong> — the 
            best DEX router on Solana. It finds the cheapest route across all liquidity pools 
            and swaps your wrapped BTC/ETH/USDC/anything into OST in seconds. Lowest fees, 
            best price, one click.
          </p>
          <div class="step-logos">
            <span class="logo-pill">Jupiter</span>
            <span class="logo-pill">Raydium</span>
            <span class="logo-pill">Orca</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="transfer-step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <h3>Deposit to Confidential</h3>
          <p>
            Your OST arrives in your public balance. Tap <strong>"Deposit to Private"</strong> 
            in the wallet → your tokens move into your encrypted confidential balance. 
            From this moment, no one on Earth can see your balance or trace your payments. 
            You're ready to spend, save, or send — privately and instantly.
          </p>
          <div class="step-logos">
            <span class="logo-pill">Confidential Transfers</span>
            <span class="logo-pill">Zero-Knowledge Proofs</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- FIAT ON-RAMP -->
      <div class="fiat-ramp">
        <h3>Coming from Fiat (Bank / Card)?</h3>
        <p>
          Use any Solana-compatible on-ramp — <strong>MoonPay</strong>, <strong>Transak</strong>, 
          or <strong>Ramp Network</strong> — available in 100+ countries. Buy SOL or USDC 
          with your card or bank transfer, then swap to OST via Jupiter. The whole process: 
          under 5 minutes from zero to private digital cash.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CONVERT DEMO -->
      <div class="convert-demo">
        <h3>How It Looks</h3>
        <div class="convert-flow">
