  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <!-- 6. OFFLINE CASH ANYWHERE -->
  <!-- ================================================================== -->
  <section id="offline" class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Offline Cash Anywhere</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        The internet isn't everywhere yet. But your money should be.
        OST works without WiFi, cell signal, or satellites &mdash; right now,
        in your pocket, ready for the person standing in front of you.
      </p>

      <div class="manifesto">
        <p class="manifesto-lead">
          Transactions at the speed of light &mdash; even when the lights are off.
        </p>

        <p>
          Imagine handing someone a banknote. No bank involved. No internet needed.
          Just two people and a piece of value changing hands. That's what cash has
          always been. OST brings that exact feeling to the digital world &mdash;
          and it works offline.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>How it works:</strong> Your OST wallet generates a complete,
          cryptographically signed payment on your device. No server call, no RPC,
          no data connection. The signed payment &mdash; with its zero-knowledge proof
          that your balance is sufficient &mdash; is shared to the receiver's device
          through whatever is available:
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid" style="margin-top:40px;">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
          <h3>NFC Tap-to-Pay</h3>
          <p>
            Hold your phone near theirs. One tap. Payment transferred.
            Like Apple Pay &mdash; but private, borderless, and without a bank
            or card network between you. Works in airplane mode.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📷</div>
          <h3>QR Code Scan</h3>
          <p>
            The signed payment fits in a single QR code (~2 KB). Show it on your
            screen, print it on paper, etch it on a metal plate &mdash; the receiver
            scans it and has a verified, valid OST payment. No internet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📡</div>
          <h3>Bluetooth Nearby</h3>
          <p>
            For slightly longer range: Bluetooth Low Energy beams the signed
            transaction to any device within 30 feet. Perfect for market stalls,
            classrooms, or a payment across the dinner table.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="manifesto" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <h3 style="color:#fff;font-size:1.3rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Cash In / Cash Out &mdash; No Internet Required</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Cash in (buy OST with USD):</strong> Walk up to any OST cash agent
          &mdash; a corner store, a street vendor, a friend. Hand them physical money.
          They tap your phone with a pre-minted bearer note (a digital banknote stored
          on an NFC sticker or QR slip). You now hold OST. Redeem it on-chain whenever
          you get online &mdash; minutes later or months later.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Cash out (sell OST for USD):</strong> Open your wallet, tap
          &ldquo;Create Bearer Note,&rdquo; enter the amount. Your OST is locked in a
          vault. Show the QR code to a cash agent. Agent scans it, hands you bills.
          Agent redeems the note later. No bank, no form, no delay.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Crypto-to-crypto exchange:</strong> You have BTC on Lightning.
          Your friend has OST bearer notes. You send Lightning sats; they tap you
          an NFC note. Both walk away with value in a different currency. No exchange,
          no order book, no KYC. Peer-to-peer, the way it was always meant to be.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="fiat-ramp" style="margin-top:48px;">
        <h3>We're Already in the Future</h3>
        <p>
          When the DePIN satellite constellation launches, even the broadcast step
          bypasses terrestrial internet. Your phone beams the signed transaction to
          a passing satellite via UHF/LoRa. The satellite relays it to a Solana RPC
          ground station. Settlement happens &mdash; even if neither party ever touches
          WiFi or 5G. <strong>True financial sovereignty, from the ground to orbit.</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

